  "description": "When Baekyoung, the Crown Prince who died in battle, returns alive three years later, Yeonhye is summoned back to court to fulfill her duties as his wife. While wary and suspicious of how much he has changed, she finds herself relying on him as she navigates the power struggle sparked by his return.\n\n**Original Novel:**   \n[Chapters](https://ridibooks.com/books/5060000001), [Volumes](https://ridibooks.com/books/5060000168)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/6325000001)\n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[English](https://manta.net/en/series/ten-thousand-lanterns-to-you?seriesId=5522)",
